# [MAILMAINT](../wg/mailmaint.html)

## Summary

The MAILMAINT working group met at IETF 127. The session included status updates on active and expired documents, followed by technical discussions on active working group drafts covering SMTPUTF8 email address syntax, email autoconfiguration, OAuth profiles for native clients, personal data portability archives, and aggregate performance reporting. Two formal polls were conducted regarding the future trajectory of `draft-ietf-mailmaint-autoconfig`. Finally, participants discussed upcoming industry events and potential new work items under Any Other Business.

## Key Discussion Points

