- Presented by the chairs ([Chair Slides](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-mailmaint-chair-slides-04)).
- **Published RFCs:**
  - RFC 10022 (UID batches)
  - RFC 10080 (Expires header)
- **Active Drafts Progress:**
  - `draft-ietf-mailmaint-imap-objectid-bis`: Ready for Working Group Last Call (WGLC).
  - `draft-ietf-mailmaint-imap-extensions-suggestions`: A new revision referencing `draft-ietf-mailmaint-imap-objectid-bis` will be issued shortly, after which it will move to WGLC.
  - `draft-ietf-mailmaint-unobtrusive-signatures`: Updated in the Datatracker with designated expert guidance and line ending canonicalization rules aligned with OpenPGP tools. Daniel Kahn Gillmor noted ongoing coordination with Sean Turner regarding S/MIME updates in the LAMPS WG.
