1. **`draft-ietf-mailmaint-imap-objectid-bis`**: Chairs to initiate Working Group Last Call.
2. **`draft-ietf-mailmaint-imap-extensions-suggestions`**: Author to publish an updated revision referencing `draft-ietf-mailmaint-imap-objectid-bis` prior to WGLC.
3. **`draft-ietf-mailmaint-smtputf8-syntax`**: Arnt Gulbrandsen to revise text so canonicalization is required at the point of comparison on the receiving system, then submit for WGLC.
4. **`draft-ietf-mailmaint-autoconfig`**: Chairs and authors to discuss refocusing the document under tighter, specific guidelines based on the working group poll results.
5. **`draft-ietf-mailmaint-oauth-public`**: Neil Jenkins to remove the refresh key mechanism, coordinate username response claims with the OAuth WG, and prepare the draft for WGLC.
6. **`draft-ietf-mailmaint-pacc`**: Proceed to WGLC following completion of `draft-ietf-mailmaint-oauth-public`.

